features.approved_resolution:
Approve an additive canonical imported-audio schema and identity contract.

A completed imported-audio workflow is represented as an existing canonical interview session with an importedAudio origin.

Provider-neutral provenance must include:
- content fingerprint;
- managed relative file path;
- original filename;
- media type;
- byte size;
- duration;
- import timestamp.

In-progress jobs and copied files remain outside the completed canonical graph.

Publish the managed copy, canonical session, transcript, and recording metadata only after successful transcription.

Duplicate completed imports are matched by content fingerprint and open the existing completed artifact.

Cancellation and failure remove only task-owned staging data.

Interrupted staging is deterministically cleaned or offered for retry.

Preserve existing legacy archive formats.
